ting jungle safari driving adventure. Explore beautiful wilderness environments, drive powerful safari vehicles and discover the thrill of off-road exploration in an immersive VR world.\n\nNavigate through challenging jungle paths, explore the surroundings and experience the excitement of a wild safari adventure. Every journey brings new places to discover and new driving challenges to overcome.\nGAME FEATURES\n\n    Jungle Safari Adventure: Explore exciting wilderness environments.\n\n    Safari Vehicle Driving: Take control of powerful safari vehicles.\n\n    Off-Road Exploration: Navigate through challenging jungle paths and rough terrain.\n\n    Wildlife Environment: Experience the atmosphere of a natural safari world.\n\n    Immersive VR Experience: Explore the adventure from a first-person VR perspective.\n\n    Exciting Driving Challenges: Test your driving skills across different environments.\n\nEXPLORE THE WILD!\n\nGet behind the wheel, discover the jungle and experience an unforgettable safari adventure.\n\nExplore. Drive. Discover the Wild!", "short_description": "Explore the wild jungle, drive powerful safari vehicles and experience thrilling off-road adventures in an immersive VR safari world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://actionsimulationsgames.blogspot.com/p/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://actionsimulationsgames.blogspot.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "